WEBVTT

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:05.199
[exhales] In the end,

00:00:07.299 --> 00:00:09.880
I was powerless, but

00:00:12.439 --> 00:00:18.100
Grandfather was not. The dragon blood
surging

00:00:18.279 --> 00:00:23.939
through her veins. With this, Ashina's
long

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:29.219
night comes to an end. [grunts]

00:00:29.299 --> 00:00:31.859
[gasping]

00:00:34.759 --> 00:00:36.459
[suspenseful music]

00:00:49.699 --> 00:00:55.699
[bones cracking] Pitiful grandchild. This
was your last wish.

00:01:06.019 --> 00:01:10.500
To see Ashina returned from the great

00:01:10.619 --> 00:01:14.500
beyond.

00:01:16.580 --> 00:01:18.580
Which means, Sekiro,

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:27.307
I must destroy you. [suspenseful music]